 "items": [
  {
   "name": "01",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3,
    "speed": 1.12
   },
   "text": "一六二八年，瑞典最猛的新战舰首航，开了一千多米，就沉了。"
  },
  {
   "name": "02",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3,
    "speed": 1.12
   },
   "text": "最离谱的是：出发前，船上的人就知道它会翻。"
  },
  {
   "name": "03",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3,
    "speed": 1.12
   },
   "text": "国王亲自下单：要七十二门大炮。"
  },
  {
   "name": "04",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3,
    "speed": 1.12
   },
   "text": "一层放不下？那就造两层。"
  },
  {
   "name": "05",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3,
    "speed": 1.12
   },
   "text": "出发前，船长让三十个水手在甲板上来回跑。"
  },
  {
   "name": "06",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3,
    "speed": 1.12
   },
   "text": "跑到第三趟，船就快翻了。"
  },
  {
   "name": "07",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3,
    "speed": 1.12
   },
   "text": "上将只叹了口气：“要是国王在家就好了。”"
  },
  {
   "name": "08",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3,
    "speed": 1.12
   },
   "text": "然后，照常出发。"
  },
  {
   "name": "09",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3,
    "speed": 1.12
   },
   "text": "那天下午，全城都来看。"
  },
  {
   "name": "10",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3,
    "speed": 1.12
   },
   "text": "一阵风，船歪了一下，又慢慢正了回来。"
  },
  {
   "name": "11",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3,
    "speed": 1.12
   },
   "text": "紧接着，又一阵风。"
  },
  {
   "name": "12",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3,
    "speed": 1.12
   },
   "text": "海水从开着的炮门灌了进去。"
  },
  {
   "name": "13",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3,
    "speed": 1.12
   },
   "text": "几分钟后，它沉在离岸一百二十米的地方，约三十人遇难。"
  },
  {
   "name": "14",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3,
    "speed": 1.12
   },
   "text": "为什么会翻？想想不倒翁。"
  },
  {
   "name": "15",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3,
    "speed": 1.12
   },
   "text": "不倒翁不倒，是因为重量全在底下。"
  },
  {
   "name": "16",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3,
    "speed": 1.12
   },
   "text": "瓦萨号正好相反：大炮雕像全在上面，水下船身又窄又浅。"
  },
  {
   "name": "17",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3,
    "speed": 1.12
   },
   "text": "一个头重脚轻的不倒翁。"
  },
  {
   "name": "18",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3,
    "speed": 1.12
   },
   "text": "国王下令严查。"
  },
  {
   "name": "19",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3,
    "speed": 1.12
   },
   "text": "船厂说：尺寸是国王您批准的。"
  },
  {
   "name": "20",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3,
    "speed": 1.12
   },
   "text": "设计师呢？前一年就去世了。"
  },
  {
   "name": "21",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3,
    "speed": 1.12
   },
   "text": "承包商更妙：只有上帝知道是谁的错。"
  },
  {
   "name": "22",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3,
    "speed": 1.12
   },
   "text": "最后，没人受罚。被问话的人，后来全都升了职。"
  },
  {
   "name": "23",
   "lang": "zh",
   "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.5,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.3,
    "speed": 1.12
   },
   "text": "那天唯一说了实话的，只有那三十个水手。"
  }
 ]
}